- Yeah.

08:56.201 --> 08:58.455
Really glad I risked my life
and everything.

08:58.622 --> 09:01.666
Yeah, you're five minutes from gone,
and you leave with that?

09:01.833 --> 09:04.710
It's like cutting a huge fart
then walking out of the room.

09:04.878 --> 09:07.839
And that's how we'll remember you,
