09:08.007 --> 09:09.967
Goodbye, big fart.

09:13.012 --> 09:14.972
So, Dylan, um...

09:15.139 --> 09:17.182
- Shouldn't you be in school?
- I don't know.

09:17.349 --> 09:18.893
