09:25.483 --> 09:27.944
- Those are dog years.
- That doesn't make any sense.

09:28.111 --> 09:31.656
You know what? If you don't like it,
go on the Internet and complain.

09:34.368 --> 09:36.745
Oh, it was awful.
That kid was a complete thug.

09:36.913 --> 09:38.790
I couldn't get out of there
fast enough.

09:38.956 --> 09:41.626
Boy, you dodged a bullet,
