ever asked for my help.

10:04.818 --> 10:06.486
Yeah, seemed like they're all set.

10:06.653 --> 10:12.618
She's done a fine job
creating a child-friendly environment...

10:16.663 --> 10:17.873
Great parenting.

10:18.040 --> 10:21.336
I don't know, Brian. Raising a child
is a very rewarding experience.

10:21.503 --> 10:23.964
You know what else is rewarding?
Shutting your vag.

10:24.131 --> 10:25.173
- What?
- What?

10:27.300 --> 10:28.468
Dylan?

10:28.635 --> 10:31.597
- What are you doing here?
- My mom wanted me to give you this.

10:31.764 --> 10:35.684
"To Brian, from Tracy.
He's your problem now.

10:35.851 --> 10:38.354
P.S. Will you write me
a letter of recommendation...

10:38.521 --> 10:40.356
