12:37.817 --> 12:42.864
<i>And each time my foot hits the ground,
I shall say, "Boing, boing, boing. "</i>

12:43.031 --> 12:47.160
I'm a girl. I don't even like
the good Monty Python sketches.

12:47.328 --> 12:49.330
Don't worry,
I got it under control, Lois.

12:49.496 --> 12:52.291
I'm monitoring Dylan from here
on Stewie's baby monitor.

12:52.458 --> 12:54.502
<i>Hey, Dylan?
Hey, come on in here for a sec.</i>

12:54.669 --> 12:56.294
<i>Stewie, why are you nude?</i>

12:56.461 --> 12:59.132
<i>Just a little something
I do once a week around here...</i>

12:59.298 --> 13:00.467
