14:04.912 --> 14:06.330
That kid's a sociopath.

14:06.495 --> 14:08.373
It's time you lay down the law
with him.

14:08.540 --> 14:09.625
I couldn't agree more.

14:09.791 --> 14:13.963
I am gonna kick him out faster than
