14:33.859 --> 14:36.654
I don't care I'm you father,
you don't care you're my son.

14:36.820 --> 14:40.408
We don't have anything in common.
It's best if you get out of this house.

14:40.575 --> 14:43.370
Fine. I hate it here anyhow.
