15:24.373 --> 15:26.291
Damn it,
don't you think I wanted to be?

15:29.962 --> 15:33.298
Shh. Shh. Shh. It's okay. It's okay.

15:33.465 --> 15:36.260
Look,
I know I wasn't there for you, man...

15:36.427 --> 15:39.597
